%%{init: {'theme': 'default', 'themeVariables': {'fontSize': '13px'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant Ops as Data Operations
    participant Jira as Jira Ticket
    participant SF_C as Snowflake<br/>COMMON.WORKIVA_ORG_DELETES
    participant SF_A as Snowflake<br/>ADMIN.WORKIVA_ORG_DELETES
    participant RS as Redshift<br/>admin.workiva_org_deletes
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant dbt as dbt Cloud

    Note over Ops: Entry: SSE has completed<br/>platform deletion and<br/>attached 6 JSON result files

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over Ops: Step 1: Identify
    Ops->>Jira: Get Org ID + Account ID<br/>from description/comments
    Ops->>SF_C: verify_deletion identify --post
    SF_C-->>Ops: Workspace list + status
    Ops->>Jira: Post workspace baseline
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note over Ops: Step 2: Redact in Snowflake (COMMON)
    Ops->>GH: Edit seed CSV in dbt_core_models<br/>Add row: org_id, account_id, date
    Ops->>GH: Open PR + merge
    GH->>dbt: Nightly job 908937 runs
    dbt->>SF_C: INSERT OVERWRITE<br/>all seed rows
    Note over SF_C: Views now return<br/>REDACTED for this org
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note over Ops: Step 3: Redact in Snowflake (ADMIN)
    Ops->>SF_A: INSERT INTO<br/>SILVER_PROD.ADMIN.WORKIVA_ORG_DELETES<br/>(org_id, account_id, date)
    Ops->>GH: Update admin_workiva_org_deletes.sql<br/>in enterprise_silver_dbt
    Note over SF_A: WORKSPACE_SOLUTION view<br/>now returns REDACTED
    end

    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
    Note over Ops: Step 4: Redact in Redshift
    Ops->>RS: psql redshift.it.workiva.net:5439
    Ops->>RS: INSERT INTO<br/>admin.workiva_org_deletes<br/>(org_id, account_id, date)
    Note over RS: audit.workiva_workspace<br/>now returns REDACTED
    end

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over Ops: Step 5: Verify
    Ops->>SF_C: verify_deletion verify --snowflake-only
    SF_C-->>Ops: PASS / FAIL
    Ops->>RS: verify_deletion verify --redshift-only
    RS-->>Ops: PASS / FAIL

    alt Any FAIL
        Ops->>Ops: Identify missing table, repeat step 2/3/4
    end

    Ops->>Jira: Post proof of redaction<br/>(SQL queries + results + PASS)
    end

    rect rgb(224, 247, 226)
    Note over Ops: Step 6: Close
    Ops->>Jira: Verify Salesforce account records
    Ops->>Jira: Post completion comment<br/>tag SSE + SaaS Ops
    Ops->>Jira: Close ticket
    end
